WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:10.590
Everything fits on a phone. The editor and the
output become Code and Output tabs, so each
one gets the full width.

2
00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:17.080
Fullscreen matters more here, because it gives
the editor the whole screen.

3
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:24.400
The storage panel works exactly the same: what
is held, and what it costs you.

4
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:32.120
And you can clear it whenever you like — saved
code, the cached runtime, or both.

